    "notes": "Advanced side (back of the 1963 card), flatbed scan (1600x928) from a 2019 collector's post of his Bill Virdon Strat-O-Matic cards (Wayback capture); read from a 0.62x whole-card overview, then a second independent pass over 1.15x per-grid crops. Situation glyphs captured as markers: omega (LHP col3 r3/r10; RHP col1 r2, col3 r10), downTriangle (LHP col2 r4, col3 r11; RHP col1 r10, col3 r11), diamond (LHP col3 r12), upTriangle (RHP col3 r12; default SINGLE (rf) plus the italic SI*/lo split printed beneath). '?' after fly balls captured as questionMark; underlined C as 'underline:C'. 'plus injury' on LHP col2 r2 and RHP col2 r12."
